1. Added the import for QueryNormalizerProvider and QueryClient
2. Created a new QueryClient instance
3. Wrapped the component with QueryNormalizerProvider and provided the necessary configuration
4. Maintained the existing ScopeProvider
5. Kept all the original component props and functionality intact

The component structure remains exactly the same, we're just adding the required providers to make it work in the preview environment. Let me know if you encounter any other errors.

